NOTE:
    - Testing {K_i, U_i} as basis for Koopman based methods
    - Testing {S_i, B_i} as basis for crosscorrelation matrix methods

Build Instructions:

    From the "src" folder, run      : nvcc -x cu -std=c++20 -w --use_fast_math -O3 -arch=native main_v16.cpp -o ../build/grph_v16

    Note, fast-math can be used without introducing unwanted inaccuracies.

Run Instructions (example):
    From the "src" folder, run: ../build/grph_v16 -w 86 -h 86 -e 100 -s 41 -tt 500 -dt 0.01 -r 10
